Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.00,0:00:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I carry high my craven flag,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.58,0:00:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,my ally I'm gonna fly and let my struggles\Nshoot me through the sky It'd be a pity
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.76,0:00:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,if we lingered here And let our pretty\Nsparks of life flindle out and disappear
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.80,0:00:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,There may be fog that even\Nyou can't navigate If someone
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.22,0:00:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,strong like you is lost then\Nwho will set me straight?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.92,0:00:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Because when the waves cast,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.74,0:00:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,my heart adrift It's been your\Nkindness and your strength
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.84,0:00:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That would free me from\Nthe mist And just like that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.82,0:00:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We move on Sail to a\Nnew dawn Weigh anchor,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.10,0:00:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,ride as high as you can I assure,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.46,0:00:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need anger I go fast as I am,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.42,0:00:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,yeah I hear you laughing like\Nyou're numb to it all Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.16,0:00:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,we're dashing together No,\Nwe're never gonna fall,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.80,0:00:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,you know The whole world may\Nnow be my enemy What a swirl,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.10,0:01:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,but I ain't backing\Ndown so long as I'm free
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.32,0:01:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Thought I'll give it. Come round\Nthe current with me. All in,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.50,0:01:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,wake up bright and early,\Nmaking for the peak we go
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.70,0:01:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,All in, wake up bright and\Nearly, making for the peak we go
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.74,0:01:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, please wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.70,0:01:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.22,0:01:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I trust you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.20,0:01:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But whatever doesn't work!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.74,0:01:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.80,0:01:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.84,0:01:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me your worst Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.34,0:02:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.86,0:02:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That bird!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.84,0:02:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't need to hold me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.40,0:02:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,A dragon doesn't run from a rat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.84,0:02:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me tell you a story,\NStraw Hat. 20 years
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.12,0:02:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,ago the people of guano watched their hero
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.10,0:02:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,boil and their country\Nburn ever since then
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.44,0:02:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,They have prayed for a new hero and now,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.70,0:02:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,here you are,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.16,0:02:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,begging to meet the same end.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.12,0:03:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Flame Dragon Torch!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.40,0:03:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not gonna throw that punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.92,0:03:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll melt you alive before\Nyou even get the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.90,0:03:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Rattletters!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.86,0:03:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Rattletters!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.98,0:03:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Ruffie!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.62,0:03:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn up the heat!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.66,0:03:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't melt me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.28,0:03:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The old man taught me how to throw\Na punch without even touching you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.56,0:03:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe I know what\Nyou mean by Haki now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.70,0:03:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's called Riyuo in the land of Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.36,0:03:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You're overstressing yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.64,0:04:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow the Haki to move to your fist\Nfrom the parts that don't use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.50,0:04:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never hurt my friends again!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.08,0:04:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Understand?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.99,0:04:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Building dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.24,0:04:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, come!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.06,0:04:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, come, come!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.22,0:04:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Blame Barcois!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.68,0:05:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, that light!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.06,0:05:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell's going on up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.74,0:05:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.42,0:05:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.74,0:05:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.94,0:05:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Give him hell, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.90,0:05:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to end this! Finish him!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.50,0:05:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Take him down!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.04,0:05:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,For 1-0!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.08,0:05:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,For 1-0!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.24,0:05:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,For 1-0! For 1-0!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.52,0:05:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We're counting on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.60,0:05:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.42,0:05:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me probe!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.42,0:05:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Onward to Cudi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.92,0:05:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.90,0:05:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord. Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.56,0:05:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't look back! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.50,0:05:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Those fools think I don't\Nknow what they're up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.00,0:05:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,They're headed to Kuri!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.16,0:06:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The heir to the Kozuki clan\Nis waiting at their castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.24,0:06:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Go kill the little brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.00,0:06:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill his whole family while you're there!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.58,0:06:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Wipe them out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.90,0:06:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll exterminate their clan!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.94,0:06:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Odin has children.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.78,0:06:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Better go finish things up then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.44,0:06:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You may have killed Lord Odin, but\Nwe won't let you kill his family!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.96,0:06:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,If anyone is stupid enough to stand\Nagainst the Shogun, shoot them dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.38,0:06:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you idiots understand now\Nthe true death of my grudge
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.92,0:06:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll all die along with\Nyour beloved Kozu-kis!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.32,0:06:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know what happened to Odin's wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.16,0:07:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We confirmed her death in Bekori town.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.56,0:07:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,No one else escaped the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.32,0:07:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Their accursed clan is gone at last!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.92,0:07:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Now time, y'all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.26,0:07:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for all of you to make a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.06,0:07:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you stand beside me\Nin service of this land?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.60,0:07:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Or will you go to war?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.36,0:07:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You know damn well what we'll say.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.44,0:07:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never be Shogun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.56,0:07:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We are loyal to the Kozuki Climb alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.76,0:07:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We will avenge Odin's death\Nno matter what it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.64,0:07:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The land of water will not fall today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.52,0:07:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Show no fear!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.42,0:07:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Onward!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.44,0:07:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.68,0:08:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that strange light?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.86,0:08:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Last breath!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.70,0:08:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone run!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.72,0:08:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I had no idea you were so weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.24,0:08:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You called yourself Samurai.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.18,0:08:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Or maybe Samurai weren't\Nworth a damn to begin with.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.62,0:08:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,To think that you looked down on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.94,0:08:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's the fool now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.48,0:08:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on the throne and you're burning\Nto death in a battle you can't win.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.70,0:08:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Face it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.74,0:08:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The weak can't protect the damn thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.78,0:08:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,now as for the rest of the country i have
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.10,0:08:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,an announcement this\Nis a new one-oh painted
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.80,0:08:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,in the calendar of the Kurozumi you're
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.86,0:09:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,all everybody's men i've\Ngot a new job for you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.50,0:09:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.68,0:09:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me back my dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.48,0:09:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't take him away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.34,0:09:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.42,0:09:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No, please don't shoot! Please let him go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.30,0:09:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's going to be alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.68,0:09:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.16,0:09:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You will all work to produce weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.36,0:09:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Put your back into it, slackers!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.52,0:09:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna work until you're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.80,0:09:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to storm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.00,0:09:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't crop crops in this soil.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.58,0:09:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Some thirst.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.24,0:10:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.78,0:10:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing to eat, nothing to drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.90,0:10:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This land is a living hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.72,0:10:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.58,0:10:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I beg of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.18,0:10:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Help us, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.88,0:10:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to live,\Nyou better keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.54,0:10:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Those goods are more important\Nthan your worthless lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.06,0:10:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Drop them in your deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.36,0:10:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This country is closed off from the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.74,0:10:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Scream as loud as you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.18,0:10:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No one will come to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.06,0:10:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't take it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.20,0:10:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd rather die than do this another day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.40,0:10:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.94,0:11:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We must survive the coming winter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.44,0:11:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,A long, cold night.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.44,0:11:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not lose faith in Lady Toki's words.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.60,0:11:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that's funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.60,0:11:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Kaido, those filthy swine will eat\Nanything, even our rejects smile fruits!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.62,0:11:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on, eat up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.54,0:11:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Then laugh till you die!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.26,0:11:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been just like Ebisu Town.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.72,0:11:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,even when you're starving\Nand mourning your loved ones,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.48,0:11:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll keep laughing like fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.70,0:11:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You're nothing but maggots, so I'm sure\Nyou'll keep eating the trash I dump on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.28,0:11:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you glad I gave you\Nall the gift of laughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.50,0:11:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Now no one has to listen to you cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.30,0:12:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Starts the banquet!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.26,0:12:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat your fill!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.36,0:12:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Every pleasure is yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.26,0:12:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Life of a dead or dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.24,0:12:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,All alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.12,0:12:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You know Gomorrah Saki, I had\Neverything, exactly as I wanted it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.72,0:12:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You're telling me you\Nworked at the Pleasure
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.64,0:12:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hall all that time just\Nto get revenge on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.20,0:12:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You're nothing but a slut!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.04,0:12:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll die when I'm taking\Nyou with me, Koboasaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.88,0:12:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the price of your betrayal!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.92,0:12:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You can serve me a drink in hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.30,0:13:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Foxfire Kin'emon and the Akazaya Samurai.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.08,0:13:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If they want to challenge\Nus, then I welcome it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.42,0:13:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll send them right back to\Ntheir graves with a single stroke.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.76,0:13:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This is pandemonium.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.98,0:14:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't move Onigashima.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.56,0:14:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I never could.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.78,0:14:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.60,0:14:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I tried my best, but I'm useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.46,0:14:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to help, but I'm not strong enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.80,0:14:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.10,0:14:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.44,0:14:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The land of Wano will soon need you. You
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.50,0:14:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,have to rebuild the Kozuki clan Mother
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.24,0:14:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I'm certain that\Nyou can do it. The people of
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.18,0:15:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Wano will see your courage.\NYou'll surely move their hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.56,0:15:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hiyori. Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.06,0:15:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.64,0:15:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I must show my courage Or I will\Nbring shame to the Kozuki clan!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.02,0:15:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.48,0:15:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot let everyone's faith go to waste!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.92,0:15:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not give up now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.62,0:15:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's them!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.22,0:15:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.72,0:15:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Kin'emon! Shiku!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.96,0:15:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You're alive, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.50,0:15:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We're making it through this together!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.62,0:15:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.02,0:15:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.46,0:15:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Strahat keep fighting you can't stop till
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.50,0:15:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaido is gone you have\Nto free us from Kaido you
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.32,0:15:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,have to free us from\NKaido you have to free
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.34,0:15:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,us from Kaido you have\Nto free us from Kaido
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.92,0:16:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,free us Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.40,0:16:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Strahat. For 20 years, this cruel
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.64,0:16:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,battle has continued alas we
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.70,0:16:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,cannot finish it alone Unless\NKaido is vanquished for good,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.12,0:16:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,it will never end!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.98,0:16:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You fought well today.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.68,0:16:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I never thought you\Ncould push me this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.00,0:16:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.58,0:16:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet, you're still not strong\Nenough to change this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.58,0:17:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I took it all with my own hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.72,0:17:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I rose to be an emperor of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.22,0:17:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's another win for Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.46,0:17:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We are unstoppable now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.60,0:17:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No one in this rotten world can defeat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.90,0:17:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all too weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.98,0:17:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know anything, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.86,0:17:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Our country's trapped in\Nan endless cycle of war!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.98,0:17:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to keep stealing\Nfrom other nations to pay
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.64,0:17:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,heavenly tribute or we'll\Nlose our rights as a kingdom,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.30,0:17:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,as human beings.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.36,0:17:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We're just slaves of the world government.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.34,0:17:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You bow to the Celestial Dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.14,0:17:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not fight back?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.06,0:18:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been drafted.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.88,0:18:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to become a marine. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.28,0:18:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would I want to be\Na government lapdog?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.76,0:18:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just say that you're a bit\Nmore than this kingdom can handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.10,0:18:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut your damn mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.28,0:18:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't make me do anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.98,0:18:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.92,0:18:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't, I'll rip you to...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.20,0:18:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hand over Kaido as we agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.90,0:18:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Your country will be given full rights.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.64,0:18:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You can even join the reverie.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.90,0:18:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Screw this country!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.14,0:18:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not your bargaining tool!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.30,0:19:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, not again
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.14,0:19:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaino's on the loose. Bastard's using us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.04,0:19:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll get caught again\Nas soon as he's hungry
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.74,0:19:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a prison ship, not a restaurant
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.80,0:19:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He's strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.28,0:19:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.96,0:19:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it says here the guy's only 15.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.66,0:19:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,A bounty like this is\Nway too high for a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.72,0:19:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.14,0:19:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.28,0:19:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to be a pirate,\Nthis is your chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.66,0:19:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Rocks wants to have a talk with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.22,0:19:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems you've got a choice to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.68,0:19:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaido joined the Rocks Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.72,0:19:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,They're invincible now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.50,0:19:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay the hell out of their way!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.98,0:19:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaido, something big just happened!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.50,0:20:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.70,0:20:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We're headed to God Valley!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.24,0:20:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Whaaaaat?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.15,0:20:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The Rocks Pirates are done for!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.82,0:20:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But how?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.08,0:20:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of joke is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.94,0:20:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,They had the strongest pirates\Nin the world on their crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.82,0:20:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard a marine named Garp took them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.88,0:20:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, I bet they just had a falling out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.54,0:20:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,They were all power and no teamwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.02,0:20:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the hell are you, Kaido?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.44,0:20:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, that little bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.48,0:20:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.32,0:20:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyo, kyo, kyo, kyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.28,0:20:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been ten years since then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.62,0:20:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you've become a one-man army, Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.66,0:20:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyo, kyo, kyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.56,0:20:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Throughout all of history,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.84,0:20:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,mankind has turned to violence\Nto solve every problem they face.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.90,0:20:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,As well they should, I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.72,0:20:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We're animals, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.70,0:20:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The strong have always conquered the weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.04,0:20:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, but what's your point?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.80,0:21:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The other remnants of the rocks pirates\Nwill grow in power, too, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.48,0:21:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Weapons will decide the future.\NAnd I have plenty to spare.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.44,0:21:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The self-appointed rulers of this\Nworld preach peace And they claim
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.64,0:21:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,that power is their birthright\NWe'll drag them from their thrones
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.62,0:21:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And on to the
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.80,0:21:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,battlefield A person's
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.80,0:21:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,worth should be determined by
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.08,0:21:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,strength That is the only way to\Nensure true justice and freedom!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.28,0:21:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but nothing's gonna stop me now!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.60,0:22:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard Yamato talking about Joy Boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.24,0:22:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,As for where he learned that\Nname, I couldn't tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.14,0:22:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But I know Odin was waiting until he\Nappeared to open up the borders of Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.84,0:22:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You're waiting for him\Nyourself, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.76,0:22:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.64,0:22:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, I know\Nexactly who Joy Boy is.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.68,0:22:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot afford to be distracted again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.60,0:22:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I must trust that Luque will triumph!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.04,0:22:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.82,0:22:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Save the land of Wano!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.74,0:22:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Set its people free!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.92,0:22:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Make those clowns!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.88,0:23:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.58,0:23:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Come forth, flame clouds!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.16,0:23:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Heave my coal!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.82,0:23:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The hell is that noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.58,0:23:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No fire can withstand this!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.50,0:23:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The waters of soul shall deliver you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.48,0:24:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Water!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.66,0:24:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like they're raining\Ndown from the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.16,0:24:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, that nose!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.06,0:24:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.18,0:24:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.58,0:24:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Move up! Give them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.42,0:24:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kick them!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.32,0:24:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry you've had\Nto endure so much pain
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.18,0:24:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,For years and years.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.40,0:24:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,you've remained strong
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.68,0:24:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I almost lost you there hey\Ndon't get washed away come back
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.50,0:24:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd this water come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.26,0:24:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa, whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.64,0:24:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.94,0:25:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Something is happening to the island!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.52,0:25:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The flame clouds, they're fading!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.70,0:25:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.14,0:25:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Our time's up! It's falling!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.90,0:25:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Come forth, Flame Clouds!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.68,0:25:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You're amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.52,0:25:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That should be enough! Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.68,0:25:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop the island!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.52,0:25:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You can count on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.68,0:25:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.12,0:26:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll crush every nation under\Nmy heel, just like Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.06,0:26:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know why you fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.24,0:26:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of world would you create?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.02,0:26:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hats!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.24,0:26:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What do I want?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.00,0:26:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Lupe!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.24,0:26:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I want a world where my friends can smile!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.48,0:26:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Where they can eat until they're full!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.48,0:26:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Every day!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.76,0:27:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Quidle!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.86,0:27:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,AHHHHHHHHHHHHHH!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.26,0:27:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,AHHH!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.32,0:28:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I said I know who Joy Boy is.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.36,0:28:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you curious, King?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.82,0:28:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.98,0:28:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the man who's going\Nto defeat me someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.26,0:28:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And maybe he doesn't exist.
